			"Message": "chore(Output): Remove stale zero-byte build artifacts from Configuration\n\nDelete 160+ empty `.js`, `.js.map`, and `.json` files under the Configuration directory that were committed as zero-byte stubs. These generated build artifacts — covering ESBuild entry points, esbuild plugins (Apply, Copy, Polyfill, Transform), polyfill shims, CEL service wrappers, and tsconfig definitions — serve no runtime purpose and clutter the repository with placeholder files.\n\nRemoving them keeps the Output element focused on actual build outputs rather than stale scaffolding, and eliminates noise in code review diffs when upstream VS Code sources are re-bundled.",
